strong><span class=\"\"> – Razendsnelle opstarttijden voor al je apps en bestanden.</span><span class=\"\"> 💾</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\"><strong class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Scherm:</strong><span class=\"\"> 13.</span><span class=\"\">6-inch Liquid Retina-display met 500 nits helderheid.</span><span class=\"\"> 🌈</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"8\">🔋 Accustatus & Conditie:</h3>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><strong class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Accugezondheid:</strong> <strong class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">99%</strong><span class=\"\"> – De batterij is dus nog in absolute topconditie!</span><span class=\"\"> 🔋</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><strong class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Laadcycli:</strong><span class=\"\"> Slechts 162 cycli.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><strong class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Staat:</strong> <strong class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"7\">Zeer nette staat</strong><span class=\"\">.</span><span class=\"\"> Geen noemenswaardige gebruikssporen,</span><span class=\"\"> technisch 100% in orde.</span><span class=\"\"> ✨</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Garantie:</strong> Inclusief <strong data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"20\">3 maanden garantie</strong> van Used Products Rotterdam West. 🛡️</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Extra:</strong> Geleverd inclusief lader, niet de originele, maar wel 1 van goede kwaliteit🔌</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
